    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to TRAUMA Broken Paradise</h2><br><strong>THIS IS NOT A WALKING SIMULATOR GAME</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfadWhat is Psychological Survival Horror?]\ud83e\ude78</h2><br><strong>\ud83c\udfad Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A subgenre of horror that focuses on <strong>the player\u2019s mind</strong>, creating fear through tension, atmosphere, and storytelling. Instead of relying on direct jump scares, it explores deep themes like <strong>paranoia, insanity, and the unknown</strong>, making the player question reality within the game.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Survival Horror</strong> \u2013 A genre centered on <strong>surviving against terror</strong>, where resources are limited, and every decision matters. The player must face terrifying threats, either through combat or specific mechanics to fight back. Fear comes not only from the enemies but also from the character\u2019s <strong>vulnerability and constant tension</strong>.<br><br>Both genres can blend, creating unique experiences where the player not only survives but also feels the <strong>psychological weight of horror</strong>. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into a World of Unseen Terror \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83d\udda4</h2>  <br>Enter the haunting world of *TRAUMA Broken Paradise*, where every corner of the mansion whispers secrets and its walls are steeped in tragedy. As Sophia Markwell, explore the dark, decaying halls of a forgotten legacy. The air is thick with the echoes of the past, and the deeper you venture, the more the lines between reality and nightmare begin to blur.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/17e56eafb81ec82e0a27b820d0cd913b.poster.avif?t=1741092713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/17e56eafb81ec82e0a27b820d0cd913b.webm?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/17e56eafb81ec82e0a27b820d0cd913b.mp4?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel a Tale of Madness and Loss \ud83d\udcdc\ud83e\udde0</h2>  <br>*TRAUMA Broken Paradise* isn\u2019t just a journey through a haunted mansion\u2014it's a descent into the fractured mind of Sophia Markwell. Influenced by the unnerving atmosphere of Stephen King\u2019s *The Shining*, this psychological survival horror game challenges your perception, as you piece together the riddles of a shattered past. Solve cryptic puzzles and face mind-bending challenges that will keep you questioning what\u2019s real.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/d2f909c1a3bf9a5614f111b31577960c.poster.avif?t=1741092713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/d2f909c1a3bf9a5614f111b31577960c.webm?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/d2f909c1a3bf9a5614f111b31577960c.mp4?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Silent Battle with the Mind \ud83e\udde9\ud83d\udc80&lt;/h2]  <br>Forget the loud jumpscares. In *TRAUMA Broken Paradise*, the true horror lies within the silence\u2014the quiet hum of your heartbeat, the rustling of a note or photograph that might hold the key to your survival. Navigate through fixed camera angles and tense, atmospheric environments, as you piece together clues that will either guide you to safety or lead you into deeper despair.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/11507ce46b7681fbce13ae09afb93f12.poster.avif?t=1741092713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/11507ce46b7681fbce13ae09afb93f12.webm?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/11507ce46b7681fbce13ae09afb93f12.mp4?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Decision Counts \ud83d\udd10\ud83d\udcad&lt;/h2]  <br>Your choices are not just choices\u2014they are decisions that will echo through your fate. Multiple endings await, each one shaped by the paths you take and the clues you uncover. Every note, every photograph you collect may hold the key to your survival, but in this mansion, knowledge may also be the most dangerous weapon.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Unseen, Discover the Unknown \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udd0e&lt;/h2]  <br>The mansion is full of secrets, and no two journeys are alike. Hidden passages, concealed achievements, and mysterious objects are scattered throughout. The more you discover, the more you\u2019ll begin to understand the twisted reality that holds Sophia captive. The question is: Are you ready to face what\u2019s buried in the darkness?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/4f4e43f920f6067fb495598132a85119.poster.avif?t=1741092713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/4f4e43f920f6067fb495598132a85119.webm?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/4f4e43f920f6067fb495598132a85119.mp4?t=1741092713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Masterpiece of Psychological Horror \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc7b&lt;/h2]  <br>*TRAUMA Broken Paradise* is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s a passion project that brings together a love for survival horror and a deep respect for the genre\u2019s roots. Every corner of this game is meticulously crafted to draw you into its haunting world. Will you dare to uncover the truths hidden in the shadows?</h2></h2></h2></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to TRAUMA Broken Paradise</h2><br><strong>THIS IS NOT A WALKING SIMULATOR GAME</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfadWhat is Psychological Survival Horror?]\ud83e\ude78</h2><br><strong>\ud83c\udfad Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 A subgenre of horror that focuses on <strong>the player\u2019s mind</strong>, creating fear through tension, atmosphere, and storytelling. Instead of relying on direct jump scares, it explores deep themes like <strong>paranoia, insanity, and the unknown</strong>, making the player question reality within the game.<br><br><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Survival Horror</strong> \u2013 A genre centered on <strong>surviving against terror</strong>, where resources are limited, and every decision matters. The player must face terrifying threats, either through combat or specific mechanics to fight back. Fear comes not only from the enemies but also from the character\u2019s <strong>vulnerability and constant tension</strong>.<br><br>Both genres can blend, creating unique experiences where the player not only survives but also feels the <strong>psychological weight of horror</strong>. \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into a World of Unseen Terror \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f\ud83d\udda4</h2>  <br>Enter the haunting world of *TRAUMA Broken Paradise*, where every corner of the mansion whispers secrets and its walls are steeped in tragedy. As Sophia Markwell, explore the dark, decaying halls of a forgotten legacy. The air is thick with the echoes of the past, and the deeper you venture, the more the lines between reality and nightmare begin to blur.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/17e56eafb81ec82e0a27b820d0cd913b.poster.avif?t=1741092713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303950/extras/17e56eafb81ec82