\ud83d\udc7b&lt;/h2]  <br>*TRAUMA Broken Paradise* is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s a passion project that brings together a love for survival horror and a deep respect for the genre\u2019s roots. Every corner of this game is meticulously crafted to draw you into its haunting world. Will you dare to uncover the truths hidden in the shadows?</h2></h2></h2></h2>",
